<title>UK: BayerischeLB to issue $1.0 bln 5yr bond.</title>
<headline>BayerischeLB to issue $1.0 bln 5yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayerische Landesbank Girozentrale will launch a $1.0 billion five-year Eurobond in the near future, joint lead manager Merrill Lynch said on Monday.</p>
<p>Nikko is the other lead manager.  </p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
